^XWB(8994,131,3,1,0)="The first piece of ';;' of each array item is the internal entry number."
^XWB(8994,131,3,2,0)="The second piece of ';;' of each array item is the value of the zeroth node."
^XWB(8994,131,3,3,0)=""
