^XWB(8994,164,3,1,0)="Pre SD*5.3*204: 1 if client ok, else 0."
^XWB(8994,164,3,2,0)="Post SD*5.3*204: RPCTimeLimit [n30-300] if client ok, else 0."
^XWB(8994,165,0)="ORQQAL LIST^LIST^ORQQAL^2^S^^^^^^1"
