^XWB(8994,1675,2,1,1,23,0)=" (22): Exemptions 1 thru 9 This is a multi-piece value delimited by "";"""
^XWB(8994,1675,2,1,1,24,0)="       in the following exemption order: 1;2;3;4;5;6;7a;7b;7c;7d;7e;7f;8;9"
^XWB(8994,1675,2,1,1,25,0)="       A one in the above positions means that exemption was used"
