^XWB(8994,1822,1,0)="^8994.01^7^7^3021120^^"
^XWB(8994,1822,1,1,0)="C&P Worksheet Templates are made of 3 files:  a form definition, a code "
^XWB(8994,1822,1,2,0)="definition, and a script definition."
^XWB(8994,1822,1,3,0)=" "
