^XWB(8994,1975,2,7,1,0)="^^3^3^3101006^"
^XWB(8994,1975,2,7,1,1,0)="This is an optional parameter, which when defined with the final end date "
^XWB(8994,1975,2,7,1,2,0)="selected in the GUI, will produce a delimited report. If this parameter "
^XWB(8994,1975,2,7,1,3,0)="is undefined, null or 0 then the standard report format will be generated."
