^XWB(8994,2233,1,0)="^8994.01^2^2^3070131^^^^"
^XWB(8994,2233,1,1,0)="GIVEN IEN (FISCAL YEAR END) THIS SUBROUTINE LOOKS UP THE RECORD AND "
