^XWB(8994,2536,3,1,0)="RESULT(0)=0 (zero) means success or -1^<error message> means failure."
^XWB(8994,2536,3,2,0)="Note that success may inclue one or more warnings in the"
^XWB(8994,2536,3,3,0)="format 0^<warning message>[^<warning message>].  Subsequent array values "
^XWB(8994,2536,3,4,0)="may contain the following IF new iens were generated by the call:"
