^XWB(8994,2540,2,2,1,0)="^^3^3^3101202^"
^XWB(8994,2540,2,2,1,1,0)="Contains the requested buffer entry fields that can be retrieved using "
^XWB(8994,2540,2,2,1,2,0)="Fileman (i.e. not an API call).  For example: "
^XWB(8994,2540,2,2,1,3,0)="""@;.01I;.02;.03;.04I;20.01;40.02;40.03;40.09;60.04"""
