^XWB(8994,2860,1,2,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,2860,1,3,0)="This Remote Prcedure will add the new entry in MAGQUEUE(2006.033)."
^XWB(8994,2860,1,4,0)="The platter volume name will be used to index with IMAGE file IEN."
