^XWB(8994,3033,1,23,0)="occurred during execution of the procedure. 0 ^ 0 ^ error message"
^XWB(8994,3033,1,24,0)="MAGOUT(0) = 1 ^ total count  lines counter of the returned array"
^XWB(8994,3033,1,25,0)="MAGOUT(1) = LAYER ID ^ ANNOTATOR ^ SAVED DATE/TIME ^ ANNOTATION VERSION ^ SOURCE ^ DELETION ^ TIU COMPLETION"
^XWB(8994,3033,1,26,0)="            ^ SERVICE/SECTION  ^ SITE# ^ DUZ"
