^XWB(8994,3154,2,1,1,2,0)="subscripts in an array that should be passed in by reference as the second"
^XWB(8994,3154,2,1,1,3,0)="argument to entry point DCRCTSET^MAGVRS51.  The first argument will"
^XWB(8994,3154,2,1,1,4,0)="contain the returned value in an array that should also be passed by"
^XWB(8994,3154,2,1,1,5,0)="reference."
^XWB(8994,3154,2,1,1,6,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,3154,2,1,1,7,0)="The values passed in should be in the format <fname>`<value>, where"
