^XWB(8994,3266,1,3,0)="LETTERS).  This RPC should not be used at the site but is for DSS Inc. to "
^XWB(8994,3266,1,4,0)="apply updates to the national letters as requested/instructed by the VA "
^XWB(8994,3266,1,5,0)="Privacy Office."
