^XWB(8994,3289,3,0)="^8994.03^3^3^3120613^^^^"
^XWB(8994,3289,3,1,0)="Returns: n < 0`errmsg, or 0'IEN of the created item, followed by"
^XWB(8994,3289,3,2,0)="lines echoing the original submission, with optional status flags"
^XWB(8994,3289,3,3,0)="if the STAT flag was set to process the item first."
