^XWB(8994,3801,2,1,1,0)="^^3^3^3140903^"
^XWB(8994,3801,2,1,1,1,0)="[MAGPARAM(""PARAM"")] - parameter name - default ""MAG USER PREF"""
^XWB(8994,3801,2,1,1,2,0)="[MAGPARAM(""FORMAT"")]  - I|Q|E|B - default ""I"" (internal)"
