^XWB(8994,3848,3,5,0)="DSIYRET(2..XX) = messages for individual report if they cannot be killed"
^XWB(8994,3849,0)="DSIYRPTR GETRPT GET RPT DATA^GETRPT^DSIYRPTR^4^^^^1"
