^XWB(8994,3921,1,0)="^8994.01^3^3^3140131^^^^"
^XWB(8994,3921,1,1,0)="Returns array similar to the Due-In Item Report [PRCP DUE-IN ITEM "
^XWB(8994,3921,1,2,0)="REPORT], but splits the data into Items on Order and Items Received by "
^XWB(8994,3921,1,3,0)="the Warehouse (list of partials)."
