^XWB(8994,3921,2,2,1,4,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,3921,2,2,1,5,0)="Please note that a greater number of records may be returned if the "
^XWB(8994,3921,2,2,1,6,0)="defined number is reached while looping through items in a Purchase "
^XWB(8994,3921,2,2,1,7,0)="Order. The additional items returned will ensure all items in the "
^XWB(8994,3921,2,2,1,8,0)="Purchase Order are accounted for."
