^XWB(8994,4045,2,3,1,2,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4045,2,3,1,3,0)="Send several data bits:"
^XWB(8994,4045,2,3,1,4,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4045,2,3,1,5,0)="DSIYDAT(FIELD#)=INTERNAL^EXTERNAL - to show what to put in this field for "
^XWB(8994,4045,2,3,1,6,0)="all records chosen.  send ""@^@"" if the data should be blanked out in each "
^XWB(8994,4045,2,3,1,7,0)="record for this field."
