^XWB(8994,4047,3,4,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4047,3,5,0)="DSIYRET(1)=-1 if the user cannot cancel"
^XWB(8994,4047,3,6,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4047,3,7,0)="DSIYRET(1)=2 If there are warnings and the user needs to confirm to "
^XWB(8994,4047,3,8,0)="cancel (use RPC again with FORCE=1 if they really want to cancel)"
