^XWB(8994,4154,1,4,0)="returns a list of equipment with PM of Deferred and a date assigned "
^XWB(8994,4154,1,5,0)="within the date range specified.  For the No PM Scheduled option, it "
^XWB(8994,4154,1,6,0)="returns a list of equipment which was entered within that last 6 months "
^XWB(8994,4154,1,7,0)="that has no PM scheduled."
