^XWB(8994,4189,3,46,0)="    @XURET@(#)=""200;101.13;.01~.02~.03^CPRS TAB~EFFECTIVE DATE~EXPIRATION "
^XWB(8994,4189,3,47,0)="                DATE^<1 to n>^~~^~~"""
