^XWB(8994,4225,1,0)="^^7^7^3200219^"
^XWB(8994,4225,1,1,0)="This RPC returns HCPCS information from the Prosthetic HCPCS file"
^XWB(8994,4225,1,2,0)="(#661.1) beginning with a specified starting value. Both active and "
^XWB(8994,4225,1,3,0)="inactive HCPCS's may be returned based on the value of an indicator."
^XWB(8994,4225,1,4,0)="If the HCPCS is inactive (STATUS (#3) external value equals ""INACTIVE"";"
^XWB(8994,4225,1,5,0)="internal value = 0), then a message ""** inactive HCPCS ** - use HCPCS:  "
