^XWB(8994,4232,1,1,0)="This RPC returns the Common Numbering Series from the Prosthetics"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,2,0)="Site Parameters file (#669.9 - for Prosthetics PO's only) and/or the PAT "
^XWB(8994,4232,1,3,0)="Number File (#442.6) for this site with Using Section (#4) = ""PC"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,4,0)="AUTHORIZED BUYER"" and Fiscal Year (#5) = the current fiscal year. For"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,5,0)="Prosthetic PO's, the Common Numbering Series from the Prosthetic Site"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,6,0)="Parameters file will always be the first entry followed by any Common"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,7,0)="Numbering Series that meet the established criteria.  Detailed PO's will"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,8,0)="only have entries from the PAT Number File (442.6) that meet the"
^XWB(8994,4232,1,9,0)="established criteria."
^XWB(8994,4232,1,10,0)=" "
