^XWB(8994,4284,1,1,0)="This RPC returns a list of Federal Supply Classification (FSC) / "
^XWB(8994,4284,1,2,0)="Product Service Code (PSC) codes from the Federal Supply Classification"
^XWB(8994,4284,1,3,0)="file (#441.2).  All codes, a list of codes beginning with the "
