^XWB(8994,4284,1,15,0)="   Successful Completion: Returns either all FSC/PSC codes, a list of "
^XWB(8994,4284,1,16,0)="    codes beginning with the requested starting value, or the specified"
^XWB(8994,4284,1,17,0)="    code with the associated identifying information in the format:"
