^XWB(8994,4289,3,11,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4289,3,12,0)="For the Description field (#.1), the format is:"
^XWB(8994,4289,3,13,0)="   file number ^ IEN ^ field number ^ n ^ description line n"
^XWB(8994,4289,3,14,0)="    where n=the word-processing field line number"
