^XWB(8994,4308,1,1,0)="This RPC continues the creation of the detailed purchase card order by "
^XWB(8994,4308,1,2,0)="creating the Control Point Activity File (#410) record and updating "
^XWB(8994,4308,1,3,0)="several fields in the Procurement & Accounting Transactions file (#442)."
