^XWB(8994,4347,3,3,0)="  Warning Message:  DSSORET(0)=""0^No Disability Codes found."""
^XWB(8994,4347,3,4,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4347,3,5,0)="  Successful Completion:  Returns one line of externally-formatted data"
