^XWB(8994,4385,2,2,1,1,0)="IFCAP Site (field #1.1 in file #669.9) - Station Number IEN - or"
^XWB(8994,4385,2,2,1,2,0)="  Station/Substation Code (field #.01 in file #411) if no Prosthetics Site"
