^XWB(8994,4568,1,0)="^8994.01^9^9^3180702^^^^"
^XWB(8994,4568,1,1,0)="Update the selected inventory point with the calculated due-ins."
^XWB(8994,4568,1,2,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4568,1,3,0)="The calculated due-ins are based on transactions (2237's) and purchase orders"
^XWB(8994,4568,1,4,0)="which have not been received in after a specified date.  The date entered"
^XWB(8994,4568,1,5,0)="should represent the date the last transaction or purchase order was received"
^XWB(8994,4568,1,6,0)="in (probably no later than 6 to 9 months in the past)."
^XWB(8994,4568,1,7,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,4568,1,8,0)="The update will remove all due-ins stored in the inventory point and reset the"
^XWB(8994,4568,1,9,0)="due-ins to the newly calculated values."
