^XWB(8994,4665,1,14,0)="    +---------------------------------------------------------------+"
^XWB(8994,4665,1,15,0)="Return DICOM imaging information from the LAB file (#63).  Image pointers in"
^XWB(8994,4665,1,16,0)="Anatomic Pathology (CY, EM or SP) are stored associated with TIU notes."
^XWB(8994,4665,1,17,0)="The TIU EXTERNAL DATA LINK file (^TIU(8925.91)) is used, the same way as"
^XWB(8994,4665,1,18,0)="Consults.  The DICOM LAB TEMP LIST file (#2006.5838) is used"
^XWB(8994,4665,1,19,0)="for Anatomic Pathology in a similar fashion as the DICOM GMRC "
^XWB(8994,4665,1,20,0)="TEMP LIST file (#2006.5839) is used for Consults."
^XWB(8994,4665,1,21,0)="Images can be exported from the TIU EXTERNAL DATA LINK file, the"
^XWB(8994,4665,1,22,0)="DICOM LAB TEMP LIST file, and the New SOP Class database."
