^XWB(8994,4927,1,0)="^8994.01^3^3^3221214^^"
^XWB(8994,4927,1,1,0)="This RPC will create a CMS MBI ONLY buffer entry. It will then queue a "
^XWB(8994,4927,1,2,0)="subroutine to create a MEDICARE (WNR) buffer entry approximately 5 "
