^XWB(8994,4971,1,0)="^^5^5^3250214^"
^XWB(8994,4971,1,1,0)="This RPC will store the patient in ^DISV against the user. This will "
^XWB(8994,4971,1,2,0)="allow the last selected patient by the user to be accessed at a later "
^XWB(8994,4971,1,3,0)="time."
