^XWB(8994,5004,1,1,0)="This RPC will cancel clinic availability."
^XWB(8994,5004,1,2,0)=" "
^XWB(8994,5004,1,3,0)="If the day being cancelled has scheduled appointments, those appointments "
^XWB(8994,5004,1,4,0)="will be cancelled and their IENs will be included in the returned JSON"
^XWB(8994,5004,1,5,0)="object."
