^XWB(8994,5004,2,1,1,7,0)="   SDCONTEXT(""PATIENT DFN"")= The name of the patient taking action on the"
^XWB(8994,5004,2,1,1,8,0)="                             calling application."
^XWB(8994,5004,2,1,1,9,0)="   SDCONTEXT(""PATIENT ICN"")= The ICN of the patient taking action on the"
