^XWB(8994,5011,3,3,0)="MRTC component will exist, but will not have any data. This "
^XWB(8994,5011,3,4,0)="also applies to other components such as CPRSPreRequisites,"
^XWB(8994,5011,3,5,0)="ConsultAssociatedStopCodes, ContactAttempts, etc."
