^XWB(8994,5145,2,1,1,3,0)="SDCONTEXT(""USER DUZ"")         = The DUZ of the user taking action on the"
^XWB(8994,5145,2,1,1,4,0)="                               calling application. "
^XWB(8994,5145,2,1,1,5,0)="SDCONTEXT(""USER SECID"")       = The SECID of the user taking action in the"
